Skrillex*)의 공격적인 워블 베이스와 빌드업·드롭 구조는 원류 영국 덥스텝과 미학적으로 뚜렷이 구분되며, 양쪽 씬 사이에는 지금도 정체성 논쟁이 남아 있다.","position":10,"album_count":0,"children":[{"id":"b91b6e58-acec-42a6-85ab-6f833f13549d","slug":"brostep","label":"Brostep","parent_id":"0b7f3998-4770-46cb-bcb9-1fac13c9d554","definition_md":"","position":101,"album_count":0,"children":[{"id":"fb6a3084-31d3-4724-ac2c-2c4fe566c348","slug":"tearout-dubstep","label":"Tearout","parent_id":"b91b6e58-acec-42a6-85ab-6f833f13549d","definition_md":"","position":101,"album_count":0,"children":[]}]},{"id":"e6857ee6-e6cc-4869-ad92-4eaf615b7cf7","slug":"riddim-dubstep","label":"Riddim","parent_id":"0b7f3998-4770-46cb-bcb9-1fac13c9d554","definition_md":"","position":102,"album_count":0,"children":[]},{"id":"ce4226a9-642e-4bde-b266-2c2ac239cef6","slug":"deep-dubstep","label":"Deep Dubstep","parent_id":"0b7f3998-4770-46cb-bcb9-1fac13c9d554","definition_md":"","position":103,"album_count":0,"children":[]},{"id":"7624bfbd-c36a-4077-9b30-eeaef9960076","slug":"melodic-dubstep","label":"Melodic Dubstep","parent_id":"0b7f3998-4770-46cb-bcb9-1fac13c9d554","definition_md":"","position":104,"album_count":0,"children":[{"id":"40a64139-6754-4290-a842-5132af581ea4","slug":"colour-bass","label":"Colour Bass","parent_id":"7624bfbd-c36a-4077-9b30-eeaef9960076","definition_md":"","position":101,"album_count":0,"children":[]}]},{"id":"0f032fb9-b034-4037-8565-c31fb6c8bdbe","slug":"chillstep","label":"Chillstep","parent_id":"0b7f3998-4770-46cb-bcb9-1fac13c9d554","definition_md":"","position":105,"album_count":0,"children":[]},{"id":"a7f39917-6ee7-4b99-92cf-22706d84d50b","slug":"future-garage","label":"Future Garage","parent_id":"0b7f3998-4770-46cb-bcb9-1fac13c9d554","definition_md":"","position":106,"album_count":0,"children":[]},{"id":"f0069252-ea14-47ef-b6bd-c9edaab2e4d4","slug":"post-dubstep","label":"Post-Dubstep","parent_id":"0b7f3998-4770-46cb-bcb9-1fac13c9d554","definition_md":"","position":107,"album_count":0,"children":[]}]},{"id":"d8cc4394-acef-4aec-8a2b-128b3880d733","slug":"ambient","label":"Ambient","parent_id":"673b4914-aea1-4aa7-a829-44b8a6c22a16","definition_md":"**앰비언트**(*ambient*)는 멜로디나 리듬보다 분위기와 공간감을 전면에 내세우는 일렉트로닉 음악으로, 배경음악처럼 흘러가도 좋고 집중해서 들어도 좋은 이중적 청취를 의도한다. 브라이언 이노(*Brian Eno*)가 1978년 《Ambient 1: Music for Airports》를 발표하며 장르명을 명시적으로 사용한 것이 출발점으로 꼽히며, 느린 전개, 긴 음의 지속, 텍스처 중심의 사운드스케이프(*soundscape*)가 핵심 특성이다.\n\n모 장르인 일렉트로닉의 다양한 기술을 흡수하면서도 댄스 플로어나 비트 중심성에서 의식적으로 이탈한다는 점에서 다운템포(*downtempo*)나 IDM과 구별된다. 아페스 무지크(*Aphex Twin*)의 《Selected Ambient Works Volume II》(1994), 모르피네 레코즈(*The Orb*) 등이 대표적이며, 이후 드론 앰비언트, 다크 앰비언트, 뉴에이지와 교차하는 수많은 파생 흐름이 생겨났다.","position":11,"album_count":0,"children":[{"id":"1f280aa1-15da-496a-af85-c7e68ca0f322","slug":"dark-ambient","label":"Dark Ambient","parent_id":"d8cc4394-acef-4aec-8a2b-128b3880d733","definition_md":"","position":101,"album_count":0,"children":[{"id":"c3ec3cd9-30ea-458a-86fe-114103971fbb","slug":"black-ambient","label":"Black Ambient","parent_id":"1f280aa1-15da-496a-af85-c7e68ca0f322","definition_md":"","position":101,"album_count":0,"children":[]},{"id":"4f4e52f5-8a9a-4bbc-8071-dc41f7d114fd","slug":"ritual-ambient","label":"Ritual Ambient","parent_id":"1f280aa1-15da-496a-af85-c7e68ca0f322","definition_md":"","position":102,"album_count":0,"children":[]}]},{"id":"4ae054b7-4ce0-4cb1-8560-fb6a57994d01","slug":"drone","label":"Drone","parent_id":"d8cc4394-acef-4aec-8a2b-128b3880d733","definition_md":"","position":102,"album_count":0,"children":[]},{"id":"46aee6ad-0214-4424-af37-7ba6d81d4670","slug":"space-ambient","label":"Space Ambient","parent_id":"d8cc4394-acef-4aec-8a2b-128b3880d733","definition_md":"","position":103,"album_count":0,"children":[]},{"id":"f8584b71-59e4-4adb-9973-48210ac5dd0a","slug":"ambient-dub","label":"Ambient Dub","parent_id":"d8cc4394-acef-4aec-8a2b-128b3880d733","definition_md":"","position":104,"album_count":0,"children":[]},{"id":"814b5f36-629e-42fc-a5fb-8bf05cca4142","slug":"new-age","label":"New Age","parent_id":"d8cc4394-acef-4aec-8a2b-